{"title": "Solution of Night Orchid", "pageid": 17811, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Solution_of_Night_Orchid", "categories": ["Alchemical extracts", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png/300px-Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/6/66/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Solution of Night Orchid image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png/300px-Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Suspension_of_Bullywug_Trumpet_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Solution of Night Orchid</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Extraction</a>. It can be combined with any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Vitriol</a> to create <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation\" title=\"Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation\">Superior Elixir of Arcane Cultivation</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This liquid solution has the colour of evening.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Solution_Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Solution_Alch